Each java class inherits from object so lets talk about the object method
hashcode.
When we implement hash code function we need to notice that if we override equals we need to override  hash code too.
since if we will add another element that yields a different hash code but has same data members then equals might yield true
but the hash code will yield a different number thus resulting in searching at the wrong place and getting a false answer.
So we want the hash code function to base on the equals data fields so objects with same fields members will yield same hash code!

